'''Baccharis''' (bak′a-ris), ''n.'' [NL., < L. ''bacchar'', better spelled ''baccaris'', ''baccar'', < Gr. βάκκαρις (sometimes spelled βάκχαρις, as if related to Βάκχος, Bacchus), an unknown plant with an aromatic
[[FIGURE]]
